WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.801
Preparing for more war.

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:02.769
That is what NATO's says

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.104
Putin is doing tonight.

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:06.039
But but while Putin makes slight

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:07.340
gains in eastern Ukraine,

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.242
his military is still suffering

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:10.510
heavy losses

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.044
You can see

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:12.512
we're going to show you in this new video

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:13.413
into OUTFRONT.

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:14.447
This is a night vision

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:15.749
recording of an attack

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:17.117
by Ukraine on Russian troops

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:18.284
in eastern Ukraine.

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:19.953
According to Ukrainian forces,

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.021
the Russian convoy

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:23.123
unexpectedly move in, moved

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.791
in on the Ukrainian forces.

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.092
And Ukraine responded.

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:27.861
I'm going to show you the aftermath

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:28.928
from the air.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:30.530
Complete destruction.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.432
The turret of a combat vehicle

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:33.833
just torn off.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.635
And then we'll show you from the ground.

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:36.403
Russian fighting

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:38.405
vehicles blown to pieces. Really?

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:40.407
This is only one part of the problem

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:42.075
facing Putin's forces tonight.

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:43.143
A growing divide

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:45.412
also between Putin's official army

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:47.080
and his private volunteer force

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.015
is also impacting the fight.

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:49.382
Today,

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:51.084
the volunteer chief is accusing

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:52.519
Russia's defense ministry

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:53.753
of, quote, treason.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:56.723
All by

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.691
the chief of the general staff

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.360
and the minister of defense

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.762
are handing out commands right and left

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:04.531
that the Wagner PMC

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:06.132
should not receive ammunition

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:07.367
They're also not helping

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:08.868
with air transport.

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.303
What is your advice?

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:12.272
There is direct opposition.

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:14.441
This can be equated to high treason.

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:18.812
All of this as Putin and Biden

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:20.780
both delivered major addresses

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:22.015
today in advance of the one year

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:23.116
anniversary of Russia's

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:24.484
invasion of Ukraine.

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:26.886
Biden declaring in no uncertain terms

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.688
the commitment of the US

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:30.690
and NATO to help Ukraine

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.759
while Putin rattles his nuclear saber.

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.928
Biden spoke in Poland just hours

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:36.963
after his historic visit to Kiev.

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:40.800
One year ago,

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.802
the world was bracing

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:45.038
for the fall of Kiev.

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:47.073
Well, I've just come from a visit to Kiev

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:49.709
and I can report kif stand strong

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:54.814
Key stands proud.

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:56.583
It stands tall,

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:58.718
and most important, it stands free.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.522
President Putin is craving lust for land

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.591
and power will fail

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:06.326
and the Ukrainian people's love

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:08.495
for their country will prevail.

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:09.596
Democracies of the world

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:10.430
will stand guard.

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:13.266
Our freedom today tomorrow and forever.

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.503
But Putin isn't going to be giving up

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:17.370
anytime soon.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:18.171
Tonight, he's

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:19.939
getting support from one of his biggest

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:22.075
and most powerful allies China.

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:22.675
China's top

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:24.577
diplomat arriving in Moscow today

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:25.211
for meetings.

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.379
And according to The Wall Street

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:27.013
Journal, Chinese

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:28.381
President Xi Jinping

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:29.549
is now planning to meet

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:31.017
with Putin in Moscow.

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:32.085
In the coming months.

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:32.418
We've got

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:34.053
all the angles covered for you tonight.

00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:35.221
Let's start with Phil Mattingly.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:35.889
He's in Warsaw.

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:37.323
That's where Biden spoke today,

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:37.824
of course.

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:38.791
Phil, how closely was

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:40.360
Biden watching Putin

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:43.730
you know, when you talk to U.S.

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:44.831
officials, they made clear

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:46.399
this speech was not a focal point

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:47.233
of the president's day

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:48.101
in order to drive

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:50.303
major edits or changes to the address.

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:53.173
He gave just a few hours later in Warsaw.

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:54.841
Their view of President Biden's

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:55.842
goal with the remarks

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:56.709
today, remarks

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:58.278
that he'd been planning and

00:02:58.278 --> 00:02:58.978
telling advisers

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:00.780
he wanted to make for several months

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.382
was to make a larger argument,

00:03:02.382 --> 00:03:04.651
paint a broader picture of the war

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:05.451
that's ongoing

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:07.820
and the kind of stakes at hand

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:09.923
for Western democracies, not just Russia.

00:03:09.923 --> 00:03:10.757
Not just Ukraine.

00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:13.092
However, the president was explicit

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:13.993
in his rebuke

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:14.594
of President

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:15.662
Putin, mentioning his name

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:17.130
ten separate times,

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.231
attempting to put to rest

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:19.232
the very argument

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:20.934
President Putin made for why

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.435
Russia invaded.

00:03:22.435 --> 00:03:23.670
In his remarks today,

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.772
but also over the course of the last

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:26.539
11 months,

00:03:26.539 --> 00:03:27.407
that was intentional

00:03:27.407 --> 00:03:27.840
and something

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:28.942
White House officials made clear.

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:30.810
The president wanted to do

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.312
in an explicit manner.

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:34.314
But the broader goal of the speech,

00:03:34.314 --> 00:03:35.248
laying out the

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:36.549
stakes, laying out the dynamics

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:37.717
here, underscored

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:39.352
something that was very clear. And U.S.

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:40.954
officials have seen in those hour

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:42.121
and 45 minute remarks

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:43.389
from President Putin today,

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:45.058
and that is that there is no endgame

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:47.193
anytime soon. There is no off grant ramp.

00:03:47.193 --> 00:03:48.995
There is no indication whatsoever

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:49.662
that President Putin

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:50.930
is going to decelerate

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:51.364
an effort

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:52.632
that has only been expanding

00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:54.701
over the course of the last 11 months,

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:55.268
and that, more

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:56.369
than anything else, has driven

00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:57.270
the president's actions

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.271
the last several days,

00:03:58.271 --> 00:03:59.606
trying to underscore

00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:00.907
that for all of the progress,

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:03.142
all of the ability to defend Ukraine

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.844
and keep the coalition together

00:04:04.844 --> 00:04:05.378
over the course,

00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:06.412
the 11 months, last

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:06.846
11 months,

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:09.215
there is a long and difficult path ahead.

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:11.284
And this fight is about more

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:12.919
than just Ukraine and Russia,

00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:13.186
something

00:04:13.186 --> 00:04:14.487
the president wanted to get across.

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:14.821
Now, it's worth

00:04:14.821 --> 00:04:16.155
noting our colleagues Oren

00:04:16.155 --> 00:04:17.023
Liebermann and Natasha

00:04:17.023 --> 00:04:18.157
Bertrand are reporting

00:04:18.157 --> 00:04:19.692
that Russia actually

00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:22.328
engaged in a intercontinental ballistic

00:04:22.328 --> 00:04:23.663
missile test yesterday

00:04:23.663 --> 00:04:26.466
while President Biden was in Kiev.

00:04:26.466 --> 00:04:28.368
According to sources, that test U.S.

00:04:28.368 --> 00:04:30.036
officials believe failed.

00:04:30.036 --> 00:04:31.938
It was not considered an anomaly,

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:32.372
nor was it

00:04:32.372 --> 00:04:34.107
considered an escalation, something

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:36.075
the Russians tested before in the past.

00:04:36.075 --> 00:04:37.343
But it was expected

00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:38.278
to have been mentioned

00:04:38.278 --> 00:04:39.846
in President Putin's remarks

00:04:39.846 --> 00:04:41.948
earlier today. Had it been successful?

00:04:42.181 --> 00:04:42.749
You'll notice

00:04:42.749 --> 00:04:44.417
it was absent from those remarks.

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:45.985
They believe it failed Kate.

00:04:45.985 --> 00:04:46.786
So interesting.

00:04:46.786 --> 00:04:48.788
Good to see you. Phil, thank you so much.

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:49.622
And well, as Phil

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:50.623
mentioned, Biden mentioned

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:51.658
Putin by name

00:04:51.658 --> 00:04:53.660
ten times in his speech today.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:54.260
Putin

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:55.662
Putin did not mention Biden

00:04:55.662 --> 00:04:57.930
once in his lengthy address in Moscow.

00:04:58.231 --> 00:04:59.699
Matthew Chance is OUTFRONT

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:09.575
with a

00:05:09.575 --> 00:05:11.611
fanfare the Russian president

00:05:11.811 --> 00:05:13.379
takes to the stage

00:05:13.379 --> 00:05:15.048
for a long awaited State

00:05:15.048 --> 00:05:17.116
of the nation address.

00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:18.284
But nearly a year

00:05:18.284 --> 00:05:20.386
since his invasion of Ukraine,

00:05:20.386 --> 00:05:22.622
no sign of remorse or regret.

00:05:23.122 --> 00:05:25.291
Only bitterness towards the West.

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:27.527
Activists in the region

00:05:27.527 --> 00:05:28.594
The responsibility

00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:30.596
for fueling the Ukrainian conflict,

00:05:30.596 --> 00:05:31.631
for its escalation,

00:05:31.631 --> 00:05:32.999
for the number of victims

00:05:32.999 --> 00:05:34.033
lies completely

00:05:34.033 --> 00:05:35.335
with Western elites

00:05:35.335 --> 00:05:36.402
and of course,

00:05:36.402 --> 00:05:38.237
with the current Kiev regime

00:05:38.237 --> 00:05:39.872
for whom the Ukrainian people

00:05:39.872 --> 00:05:41.607
are essentially strangers.

00:05:41.607 --> 00:05:43.876
By blaming others inside,

00:05:43.876 --> 00:05:44.944
the Kremlin tries

00:05:44.944 --> 00:05:46.045
to explain why

00:05:46.045 --> 00:05:48.247
its special military operation.

00:05:48.247 --> 00:05:49.482
Let's move down this way

00:05:49.482 --> 00:05:51.584
to last just days or weeks,

00:05:52.051 --> 00:05:53.653
almost in its second year

00:05:53.653 --> 00:05:55.388
with no end in sight.

00:05:55.388 --> 00:05:56.656
We've learned that what we thought

00:05:56.656 --> 00:05:57.290
we might

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:58.691
across Russia,

00:05:58.691 --> 00:05:59.192
there were even

00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:01.327
public screenings of the speech

00:06:01.327 --> 00:06:04.063
to ensure the Kremlin message is heard

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:06.933
that military setbacks, failures

00:06:07.066 --> 00:06:08.167
and bloodshed

00:06:08.167 --> 00:06:10.536
are all part of a conspiracy

00:06:10.536 --> 00:06:13.005
to bring Russia to its knees.

00:06:13.005 --> 00:06:14.474
It is up to me

00:06:14.474 --> 00:06:15.575
where words very easily

00:06:15.575 --> 00:06:16.442
the Western elites

00:06:16.442 --> 00:06:18.044
do not conceal their goals,

00:06:18.044 --> 00:06:20.012
as they say, it's a direct quote

00:06:20.012 --> 00:06:22.448
to bring Russia a strategic defeat.

00:06:22.448 --> 00:06:24.050
What does that mean for us?

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.285
It means to end us once and for all.

00:06:26.285 --> 00:06:27.720
We understand it exactly,

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.222
and we'll react to it accordingly,

00:06:29.222 --> 00:06:30.656
because this is about the very

00:06:30.656 --> 00:06:31.924
existence of our country.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.729
It doesn't feel that way in Ukraine,

00:06:37.196 --> 00:06:38.798
where troops are dying on

00:06:38.798 --> 00:06:40.533
bleak battlefields,

00:06:40.533 --> 00:06:42.835
defending grim front lines

00:06:42.835 --> 00:06:44.604
against a Russian foe.

00:06:44.604 --> 00:06:46.072
Ukrainian officials pouring

00:06:46.072 --> 00:06:49.008
scorn on Putin's remarks as irrelevant

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:51.277
and confused

00:06:52.378 --> 00:06:54.180
There's growing criticism in Russia

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.948
to his new images

00:06:55.948 --> 00:06:57.450
emerge of more coffins

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.252
reportedly from the front lines.

00:06:59.252 --> 00:07:00.520
One prominent Russian

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.788
military blogger

00:07:01.788 --> 00:07:04.056
complained that Putin held back

00:07:04.323 --> 00:07:06.592
from officially declaring war,

00:07:07.059 --> 00:07:09.529
not a word about failures and defeats,

00:07:09.529 --> 00:07:10.430
he writes.

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.899
There's no point listening any further,

00:07:13.099 --> 00:07:14.267
but I see.

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:17.336
But there was one major new announcement,

00:07:17.403 --> 00:07:20.006
one escalation

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:21.474
to applause

00:07:21.474 --> 00:07:23.576
Putin suspending participation

00:07:23.776 --> 00:07:25.711
in Moscow's last remaining

00:07:25.711 --> 00:07:27.480
nuclear arms treaty

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.248
with the United States.

00:07:29.248 --> 00:07:32.051
And a warning that Russia may restart

00:07:32.418 --> 00:07:33.753
nuclear tests

00:07:33.753 --> 00:07:35.521
between you and me and say,

00:07:35.521 --> 00:07:36.422
what do we do?

00:07:36.722 --> 00:07:38.858
Of course we will not do it first.

00:07:38.858 --> 00:07:39.625
But if the U.S.

00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:40.726
conducts its tests,

00:07:40.726 --> 00:07:42.161
we will do it as well.

00:07:42.161 --> 00:07:43.963
Nobody should have dangerous illusions

00:07:43.963 --> 00:07:45.031
that global strategic

00:07:45.031 --> 00:07:46.365
parity can be broken.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.502
No illusion either.

00:07:49.502 --> 00:07:49.802
When it

00:07:49.802 --> 00:07:52.171
comes to Russia's standoff with the West,

00:07:53.473 --> 00:07:55.908
the Kremlin is even thinking

00:07:55.908 --> 00:07:58.377
about backing down

00:08:00.379 --> 00:08:01.481
After hearing

00:08:01.481 --> 00:08:03.282
Putin's uncompromising speech.

00:08:03.282 --> 00:08:04.517
A source close to the Ukrainian

00:08:04.517 --> 00:08:05.585
president told me tonight

00:08:05.585 --> 00:08:06.252
that the only way

00:08:06.252 --> 00:08:07.053
this ever going to be peace

00:08:07.053 --> 00:08:08.955
talks is if there are more Ukrainians

00:08:08.955 --> 00:08:10.456
victories on the battlefield.

00:08:10.456 --> 00:08:12.992
The sooner Ukraine gets the weapons

00:08:12.992 --> 00:08:14.727
it needs, this source told me.

00:08:14.727 --> 00:08:16.662
The sooner this war can come to an end.

